{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/extras/2a82eea1d125fdf71a02321a0183d8b1.avif?t=1758247465\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Blind Box Collectors, to Your Healing Desktop Pet Paradise!The unknown and surprises are the greatest joys of unboxing blind boxes. Let the adorable blind box figures stay on your screen to accompany you! Collect, nurture, and take care of your little figures, and help them defeat the monsters in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/extras/6e0da5da03eb8fdc1d17f38bcfe395af.avif?t=1758247465\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Tap Tap Tap! Keyboards and Mouse Bring Surprises</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you tap the keyboard or click the mouse, you get closer to the blind box! The more active your interactions, the more figures you'll collect! When your energy is full, a mysterious blind box will pop out with a &quot;pop&quot;! The diligent little owner is the cutest\u2014soft and cute figures, sexy collectibles will become your electronic dopamine! Haha, tapping the keyboard just got more energetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/extras/8a805f5cb8c07133701a149c7e96f05a.avif?t=1758247465\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>POP! Blind Box Poke Fun, Soft/Cute and Sassy Figures Unite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle poke on the mysterious blind box unlocks a series of collectible cute items(rare,various hidden, collector\u2019s, and exclusive figures) bringing vitality to your desktop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/extras/d1ef22b597be91b04567783d1931a6e1.avif?t=1758247465\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2726 <strong>Satisfying!</strong> <strong>Adventure Through Levels with Your Beloved Figures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to unboxing, we\u2019ve prepared a puzzle card RPG for your leisure time. The core gameplay involves matching blocks and releasing skills. By matching blocks, you accumulate skills for your figures, creating explosive combos. The more blocks you clear, the greater the damage to the level boss. Each level has a three-star completion condition and obstacles that prevent figures from accumulating skills. Grab your beloved figures, assemble your ideal lineup, and embark on a thrilling elimination adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/extras/c89a17bf3c1823bbdb2a1bb1cefa6c21.avif?t=1758247465\" width=1280 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996250?t=1758247465","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/cd40f121b95904cf6bd3acd617bae3dfe4c51b18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758247465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996250/b6df5febb06fc5b001bda442777a65204e5587f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758247465","capsul